1
00:00:00,916 --> 00:00:03,256
(Sheldon:)For the record, I should let you know...

2
00:00:03,418 --> 00:00:08,088
(Sheldon:)...this is my first time
driving an actual motor vehicle.

3
00:00:08,298 --> 00:00:10,638
(Penny:)-You have your learner's permit, right?
-Yes.

4
00:00:10,801 --> 00:00:13,971
And I've logged a considerable number
of hours on a simulator.

5
00:00:14,137 --> 00:00:16,637
(Sheldon:)-Good.
-Didn't work out well.

6
00:00:16,807 --> 00:00:18,637
-All right. Can we go?
-One moment.

7
00:00:18,809 --> 00:00:22,769
(Sheldon:)According to my Driver's Ed book,
the side mirror is properly adjusted...

8
00:00:22,938 --> 00:00:26,648
...when a portion of the driver's door
handle is visible in the lower right corner.

9
00:00:26,817 --> 00:00:28,737
There's the handle. Back. Too far.

10
00:00:28,902 --> 00:00:31,902
(Sheldon:)Bringing it back.

11
00:00:32,072 --> 00:00:33,202
Optimized. Ahem.

12
00:00:33,365 --> 00:00:37,115
(Sheldon:)Now, where is the switch
to adjust the passenger-side mirror?

13
00:00:37,286 --> 00:00:38,786
(Penny:)It's right there.

14
00:00:40,789 --> 00:00:42,869
Where is the passenger-side mirror?

15
00:00:44,001 --> 00:00:46,131
(Penny:)In a parking lot in Hollywood.

16
00:00:46,503 --> 00:00:51,253
(Penny:)-Now, can we please go?
-Yes. Soon as I adjust my seat.

17
00:00:52,217 --> 00:01:00,027
(Sheldon:)Whee!

